AUDIO: 'video here. So, today I want to focus more specifically on the first two layers, on the built-in memory and the external memory provider. My next video is going to go deeper into setting up an Obsidian LLM wiki that complements the agent memory we\'re setting up today.'

[02:45] [scene:talk]
