[06:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'brings in different memory tiers like working, episodic, semantic, and a scratchpad where each one is optimized for different access patterns. Everything stays local, which is good for privacy. It has sub-100 millisecond queries and it has native Hermes'

[06:43] [scene:talk]
